# Untitled

Core–shell CdS@ZIF-8 structures for improved selectivity in photocatalytic \(\mathsf{H}_{2}\) generation from formic acid
Min Zeng\(^{1,2\ddagger}\), Zhigang Chai\(^{3\ddagger}\), Xin Deng\(^{2}\), Qi Li\(^{2}\), Shiqiang Feng\(^{2}\), Juan Wang\(^{1\ddagger}\) (✉), and Dongsheng Xu\(^{2}\) (✉)
